Frequently Asked Questions
What's the difference between interior detailing and a regular car wash? A regular car wash usually focuses on the exterior with a quick interior vacuum, while interior detailing is a deep, dedicated clean of every cabin surface. Detailing includes extraction cleaning, steam cleaning, and panel care that a regular wash doesn't cover.
How long does a professional interior detail take? A professional interior detail typically takes 2 to 4 hours, depending on the car's condition and size. Heavily soiled interiors or added stain treatment can take longer.
How often should I get my car's interior detailed in Pune? Most cars in Pune benefit from interior detailing every 3 to 6 months, given the dust and traffic conditions. Cars used for daily commuting may need it more often.
Can interior detailing remove bad odors from my car? Yes, interior detailing can remove most odors by deep cleaning the source, whether it's trapped in upholstery, carpets, or vents. Persistent odors from deeper issues may need a few additional treatments.
